{'symbol': 'TRV', 'date': '2021-02-15 13:57:00', 'title': 'TRAVELERS AND THE TRAVELERS CHAMPIONSHIP TO MATCH UP TO $1 MILLION IN DONATIONS TO THE HOLE IN THE WALL GANG CAMP AFTER DEVASTATING FIRE', 'text': 'HARTFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE TRAVELERS COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE: TRV) AND THE TRAVELERS CHAMPIONSHIP TODAY ANNOUNCED A JOINT COMMITMENT TO MATCH UP TO $1 MILLION IN DONATIONS TO THE HOLE IN THE WALL GANG CAMP IN THE WAKE OF A SIGNIFICANT FIRE ON FRIDAY NIGHT THAT DESTROYED A NUMBER OF BUILDINGS ON THE GROUNDS OF THE CAMP IN ASHFORD, CONNECTICUT. “FOR MORE THAN THREE DECADES, THE HOLE IN THE WALL GANG CAMP HAS BROUGHT HOPE AND HEALING TO CHILDREN AND FAMILIES STRUGGLING WITH SERIOUS ILLNES'}